  "_comment": "Hand-written: the expert groups of each golem-fx pedal, in the block sheet's order. The front panel is the pedal face (faces.json); every other parameter sits in exactly one group. `custom` is the bool parameter that unlocks the group (its params greyed until it is on); null when the group has none. Checked by tools/build-descriptors.py against the code. `help` gives the one-line help of parameters whose documentation table leaves the role empty. `depends` greys a parameter that only acts in one mode (the builder checks the value is an option). `presets` holds reference settings of crates without a VOICING table (enum values as option labels).",
